{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"We understand. We are your playthings. But I opened that gate for a reason. Your reputation in Ravnica is of that of a great wizard. A king among kings in your own right. You have us hanging in the balance once again. I implore you to use the leadership you would amongst the sage wizards under your care.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T04:49:04.705000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744779812773560410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Who are you that I should care?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T04:50:07.455000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744780075966398607","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"I am Hiram Abiff of the dunes. Sculpter of glass and stone. He who walks ahead. But my pedigree is equal to the other man who is held here under your spell. I submit humbly to your judgement. Know that of the two of us one is a sorcerer who seeks to bring up those around him. To grow and set the path of others not unlike your college. For thousands of years we have fought. And for thousands of years pain and wrath have been wrought.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T04:54:28.504000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744781170885263461","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Niv nods to you. \"Everlasting pain means the fun of life is striped from others.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T04:56:12.554000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744781607302463508","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
