{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Everlasting pain is not what I desire. My desire is simple, I only wish to rule what I was born to. He has hid behind others, putting them forward to be slain again and again, removing their tongues in the name of a cause that fits to maintain a broken world. He hides in that sphere hoping another to do his bidding. I seek to take no action against you, only to deal with a conflict that has lasted millennia. I will await your desire Lord Niv-Mizzet\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T05:01:27.637000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744782928856219765","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Ruling is not as simple as birthright.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T05:03:50.453000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744783527870201897","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Exactly, it is earned, but refused to be relinquished by the one in power\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T05:04:30.231000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744783694710964267","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"I set down my crown only moments ago.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T05:04:53.601000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744783792731848704","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
